        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter who you are or where you're from, forget about all that stuff from now on and leave your troubles behind!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Host"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Obsidian Festival needs each and every one of you to take part in it!! Live it, breathe it, feel it!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Host"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me see those hands! I want to see all of y'all!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Host"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
