    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_017_3#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "This year, we're going to select our Hottest Artist, just like we do always do!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Host"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, while you're having the time of your life during the festival, don't forget to <color=#ee4321>vote</color>!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Host"
    },
    {
        "text": "Attention! You will only have <color=#ee4321>one chance</color>to vote, and you won't be able to change your mind after you've made your decision.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Host"
    },
    {
        "text": "But don't worry, as the results <color=#ee4321>will not affect</color> the rewards you get!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Host"
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as you cast your vote and <color=#ee4321>complete all the milestone missions</color>, you'll receive the milestone rewards corresponding to the artist you voted for!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Host"
    },
